<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>小地图指针捕获边界</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../MINIMAP-POINTER-CAPTURE-EVIDENCE.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><h1 id="小地图指针捕获边界">小地图指针捕获边界</h1><p>证据：<code>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.Base/ZoomArea.xaml.cs</code> 的 <code>GridEagleEye_MouseDown</code> 只设置 <code>isMouseDown</code>、计算点击后的选择区域并记录起点。<code>GridEagleEye_MouseMove</code> 在左键按下、已进入拖动且位置发生变化时才调用 <code>CaptureMouse</code>，随后移动选择区域；<code>GridEagleEye_MouseUp</code> 释放捕获。原始 XAML <code>ZoomArea.xaml</code> 将这些事件绑定到 <code>GridEagleEye</code>。</p>
<p>本线修复 <code>src/VisionEditor/WorkflowCanvas.cs</code> 的 WPF 小地图：按下时不抢占鼠标捕获；只有指针位移并保持左键按下时才捕获和导航。<code>tests/MinimapCaptureChecks</code> 在实际 WPF 窗口中调用按下事件，验证点击已处理但鼠标未被提前捕获。</p>
<p><strong>证据范围</strong>：捕获时机属于反编译源码确认行为；鼠标桌面硬件拖动、不同 DPI 和滚动坐标等同原生尚未差分验证。本次未触及画布路由算法，也不据此声明 F-09 全面闭合。</p>
<p class="meta">来源：docs/MINIMAP-POINTER-CAPTURE-EVIDENCE.md · SHA256 21b8a1891114967fbcdf4d62493c748c84de65eadf3014d3215b5d7fb995199a<br>本页只转换阅读格式，结论与历史进度保留原文。</p></main></html>